r all with areas containing all matters of difficulty. It CAN be really hard, expect resistance. But also have a fun time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join our Discord for frequent updates and progress on the game! :D </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392280/extras/d9c99a3430443e26054f718c833b91d3.avif?t=1768226890\" width=590 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392280/extras/25b82ffc66408c2b9865b64a6cb61530.apng?t=1768226890\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392280/extras/25b82ffc66408c2b9865b64a6cb61530.poster.avif?t=1768226890\" class=\"bb_img\" width=590 height=32 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Blockage"],"dlc":[3535840],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392280/d8d6368fd41aa54781ff592651f256118cd7a7c6/header.jpg?t=1768226890","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any (With Proton)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Your voice!</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any (With Proton)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Present<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Some Li